[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60} \quad \text{(Equation 1)}
