[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m ### Step 2: Use second scenario
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m She walks **at speed $ s + 2 $ km/h**, and total time is 2 hours and 24 minutes = **2.4 hours**.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m So:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
