[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60} \quad \text{(Equation 2)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m ### Step 3: Solve system of equations
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m From Equation 1:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m \frac{9}{s} = 4 - \frac{t}{60} \quad \Rightarrow \quad \frac{t}{60} = 4 - \frac{9}{s}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m \quad \Rightarrow \quad t = 60\left(4 - \frac{9}{s} \right) \quad \text{(Equation 1a)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m From Equation 2:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{t}{60}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m Now substitute $ t $ from Equation 1a into this:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \frac{1}{60} \cdot \left(60\left(4 - \frac{9}{s}\right)\right)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = 2.4 - \left(4 - \frac{9}{s}\right) = 2.4 - 4 + \frac{9}{s} = -1.6 + \frac{9}{s}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m So now we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} = -1.6 + \frac{9}{s} \quad \text{(Equation A)}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m ### Step 4: Solve for $ s $
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m Multiply both sides by $ s(s + 2) $ to eliminate denominators:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 9s = (-1.6 + \frac{9}{s}) s(s + 2)
