[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 9! = 2^7 \times 3^4 \times 5^1 \times 7^1
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m $$
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m ---
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=39871)[0m ### **Step 3: Identify the structure of possible divisors**
